&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Experience Designer supporting international expansion initiatives, you will partner with cross-regional partners (country managers, localization experts, researchers, product specialists, engineers,&amp;nbsp; data scientists, etc.)&amp;nbsp; to craft beautiful, usable, forward-looking products that empower people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our design charter is to help foster an emotional connection with our community, keeping usability and accessibility as our prime virtues. We do our best to practice inclusive design at every turn, spanning across online and offline experiences we create for our Host and Guest communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Experience Designer, you will play a critical role in shaping how Airbnb shows up in markets across APAC and globally. You will help ensure our global products feel truly local—adapting core experiences to regional needs while feeding market insights back into the broader product strategy. Sitting at the intersection of product, design, and regional strategy, you will work across time zones and functions to define and deliver an international roadmap that spans both tactical UI improvements and larger strategic bets. You will bring a high bar for visual and interaction design craft, model AI-enabled ways of working, and provide design leadership in a space that is growing in complexity and impact for Airbnb globally. The Staff Experience Designer is an individual contributor (IC) role that will report to a Manager or Director of Experience Design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of multiple international initiatives — define design strategy, objectives and set the vision for the holistic user experience; lead detailed design execution with systematic thinking and bar-lifting craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and shape the evolution of the Airbnb platform from a design perspective through international lenses; ensure consistency with, and contribute to, our brand architecture and product architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Country Managers, Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientist, Researchers, Localization Managers and Writers to define problems &amp;amp; goals, map user flows, prototype interactions, and launch new products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence global leadership and stakeholder decision making through a clear point of view via vivid storytelling, help the team navigate ambiguity, define and solve complex problems for a global audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope projects (in partnership with DPMs, PMs and engineers) and help define the design process, task allocation, and timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide indirect leadership and mentorship for peer designers through in-depth interaction and visual design critiques; evangelize design thinking and best practices across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designer/Design Leader with 10+ years of experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to independently formulate design directions and processes, while effectively leading and mentoring teams through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic thought leader adept at guiding teams through ambiguity, establishing clear visions, and driving design strategies for global products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-oriented thinker capable of looking beyond digital interfaces to design comprehensive, holistic online and offline user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibits exceptional craftsmanship, underpinned by advanced interaction and visual design capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possesses strong analytical acumen and deep empathy, with a proven track record of synthesising user insights into optimal solutions and actionable design milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling, presentation, and communication skills, coupled with adept stakeholder management abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in end-to-end product development (from conception to launch) or spearheading the redesign of major product elements, including the application and evolution of mature design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of technological capabilities, business objectives, and user needs, alongside their respective opportunities and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence are at the heart of the Airbnb product. From Trust to Payments, and from Customer Service to Marketing we rely on ML to ensure that guests and hosts have the best possible experience with Airbnb.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Assistance Engineering Machine Learning team is the core team responsible for driving CSxAI (Customer Support x Artificial Intelligence) initiatives by adopting the Generative AI technologies to enable an intelligent, scalable and exceptional service experience. The team develops and enhances various AI models, ML services and tools including LLM fine-tuning and optimization, RAG/Search,&amp;nbsp; LLM evaluation and testing automation, feedback-based learning and guardrail for a wide range of applications in Airbnb.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The richness of Airbnb&#39;s data, the complexity of its marketplace and the variety innate in our product mean that we need to operate at the state of the art of AI practice. We are committed to investing in long term innovation to solve the complex problems we face, and to do that we need the very best experts in ML and AI to join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our current customer experiences in these domains are only scratching the surface of the innovations that are possible, and that science is at the heart of delivering a step-function change for our Guest and and Host on Airbnb.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build and leverage cutting edge AI technologies to transform Airbnb’s customer service by delivering personalized, easy-to-use and proactive customer service experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Many of the initiatives you’ll tackle are in their early conceptual stages. You will have the opportunity to shape these ideas from inception to production, turning visionary concepts into impactful realities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envision, champion, and support the development of novel ML systems, product integrations, and performance optimizations to solve real-world problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product, design, and other engineering counterparts to design and build efficient AI solutions for Airbnb CS products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and share the latest AI/ML technologies with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD/Master’s degree, preferably in CS, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9+ years of ML engineering experience, with ownership responsibility over large-scale software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in the design and development of AI and ML systems and services, and a deep passion for building efficient and scalable ML-powered products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLM driven chatbot and Agentic AI products would be a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work well within a team and with teams across the engineering, product &amp;amp; design organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
